{%- comment -%}
  A section wrapper around the cart-count snippet, so cart updates can ask
  the Section Rendering API for just the bubble
  (`/cart/change.js?sections=cart-drawer,cart-count`) instead of re-rendering
  the whole header — which would mean recompiling the mega menu on every
  quantity change.

  Never placed in a template; it exists only as a rendering target.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- render 'cart-count' -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.cart_count.name",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
